\">הַיָּצוּעַ</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיֶּא׳ אֶת־הַבַּיִת בַּעֲצֵי אֲרָזִים</span>; of a snare catching the heel, in metaph. <a data-ref=\"Job 18:9\" href=\"/Job.18.9\">Jb 18:9</a>; fig., subj. God <a data-ref=\"Psalms 77:5\" href=\"/Psalms.77.5\">ψ 77:5</a>; God’s hand <a data-ref=\"Psalms 139:10\" href=\"/Psalms.139.10\">139:10</a>; subj. pain, sorrow, fear, etc. <a data-ref=\"Exodus 15:14\" href=\"/Exodus.15.14\">Ex 15:14</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 15:15\" href=\"/Exodus.15.15\">15</a> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 1:9\" href=\"/II_Samuel.1.9\">2 S 1:9</a> <a data-ref=\"Job 21:6\" href=\"/Job.21.6\">Jb 21:6</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 30:16\" href=\"/Job.30.16\">30:16</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 48:7\" href=\"/Psalms.48.7\">ψ 48:7</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 119:53\" href=\"/Psalms.119.53\">119:53</a> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 21:3\" href=\"/Isaiah.21.3\">Is 21:3</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 33:14\" href=\"/Isaiah.33.14\">33:14</a> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 13:21\" href=\"/Jeremiah.13.21\">Je 13:21</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 49:24\" href=\"/Jeremiah.49.24\">49:24</a>; subj. man, obj. fear, etc. <a data-ref=\"Job 18:20\" href=\"/Job.18.20\">Jb 18:20</a> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 13:8\" href=\"/Isaiah.13.8\">Is 13:8</a>; obj. <span dir=\"rtl\">דֶּרֶךְ</span> <em>take one’s way</em> <a data-ref=\"Job 17:9\" href=\"/Job.17.9\">Jb 17:9</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">יֹאחֵז צַדִּיק דַּרְכּוֹ</span> AV RV <em>hold on his way</em> (cf. <a data-ref=\"Job 23:11\" href=\"/Job.23.11\">23:11</a> supr., & Assyrian <em>ṣabâtu urḫu</em>, e.g. V. R <sup>1, 74</sup>);—abs. <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 7:3\" href=\"/Nehemiah.7.3\">Ne 7:3</a> of barring gates; pt. pass. <em>caught</em> <a data-ref=\"Ecclesiastes 9:12\" href=\"/Ecclesiastes.9.12\">Ec 9:12</a>; <em>fastened, held</em> <a data-ref=\"Esther 1:6\" href=\"/Esther.1.6\">Est 1:6</a>; <em>taken</em> (by lot) <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 24:6\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.24.6\">1 Ch 24:6</a><sup>(×3)</sup> (on text v. Öt); <em>taken out</em> of a number <a data-ref=\"Numbers 3